# Capacitor native projects. `ios/` and `android/` ARE committed once scaffolded — they
# hold signing config and native tweaks — but everything generated inside them is
# covered by the ios/.gitignore and android/.gitignore that Capacitor ships, so those
# paths are deliberately not repeated here. Adding them again is what let the copied
# web assets and android/local.properties get committed in the first place.
.capacitor/
